# Build context of services/mcp-gateway/Dockerfile, which is the repository root. BuildKit reads
# this file instead of a .dockerignore at the root.
#
# Only what `uv sync --package ais0c-mcp-gateway` needs gets in: uv reads every workspace
# member's pyproject.toml to check uv.lock, and builds the gateway and the workspace packages it
# depends on, and the connectors and policies the image carries. Docs, tests, other configuration, deploy files and local secrets stay out.
*
!.python-version
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!harness/pyproject.toml
!packages/*/pyproject.toml
!services/*/pyproject.toml
!packages/contracts/src
!packages/policy/src
!packages/storage/src
!services/mcp-gateway/src
!config/connectors
!config/policies
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
